{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "免", "id": "免"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "怒", "id": "怒"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "木", "id": "木"}, {"form": "為", "id": "爲"}, {"form": "玉", "id": "玉"}, {"form": "畏", "id": "畏"}, {"form": "荒", "id": "荒"}, {"form": "請", "id": "請"}, {"form": "連", "id": "連"}, {"form": "馬", "id": "馬"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.910365211635902, "source": "小", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 2.603512392195847, "source": "小", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.622683139184121, "source": "小", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.7562145318086435, "source": "小", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 3.414442608412176, "source": "小", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.8050046959780757, "source": "小", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 1.8050046959780757, "source": "小", "target": "請"}, {"weight": 1.8050046959780757, "source": "小", "target": "怒"}, {"weight": 1.910365211635902, "source": "畏", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.0630673512486983, "source": "畏", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.4211908354018927, "source": "勝", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 1.0630673512486983, "source": "請", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.7280436548419473, "source": "仁", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.8807457944547437, "source": "仁", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.034896474282002, "source": "仁", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 3.5198031240700023, "source": "智", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.672505263682799, "source": "智", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.826655943510057, "source": "智", "target": "爲"}, {"weight": 2.133508762950112, "source": 